title: "Spyo-GENOMiCUS-399: pangenomic decomposition of the Streptococcus pyogenes accessory genome"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for non-negative matrix factorization of the Streptococcus pyogenes
  accessory genome across 399 complete genomes into 11 phylons.
